Search Autocomplete
Prefix-tree (Trie) with per-node frequency counters, top-K result ranking by frequency, and lexicographic tiebreaking. Exposes POST /train for learning terms and GET /autocomplete?q=... for prefix search.
Architecture
Trie Structure
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#ffffff"}}}%%
flowchart TB
    subgraph "Trie for terms: 'design', 'developer', 'database'"
        ROOT["root(freq=0)"]
        D["d(freq=0)"]
        E["e(freq=0)"]
        S1["s(freq=0)"]
        I["i(freq=0)"]
        G["g(freq=0)"]
        N1["n(freq=0)"]
        END_DESIGN["◻freq=3'design'"]
        V["v(freq=0)"]
        END_DEV["◻freq=2'developer'"]
        A["a(freq=0)"]
        T["t(freq=0)"]
        END_DB["◻freq=1'database'"]
        A2["a(freq=0)"]
        B["b(freq=0)"]
        END_DEV2["◻freq=5'dev'"]
    end

    ROOT --> D
    D --> E
    E --> S1
    S1 --> I
    I --> G
    G --> N1
    N1 --> END_DESIGN

    E --> V
    V --> END_DEV

    D --> A
    A --> T
    T --> END_DB

    D --> A2
